## Change

- Match Java `setOffsetMsgId(null)` behavior by clearing both the offset value
  and the effective client message ID. Conversion to a base-typed
  `MessageExt` preserves the cleared raw state.
- Record explicit boolean expectations for the cleared offset and effective ID;
  the Java fixture serializer omits map entries whose value is null.
- Keep custom subtype offset getter/setter dispatch and inherited `UNIQ_KEY`
  precedence covered by the existing invoked direct-consume cases.

